{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「鼎爺」李家鼎細仔李泳豪一家人早前捲入媽媽施明病逝風波，長子李泳漢被指隱瞞死訊，長期索錢，更獨攬身後事處理權，拒絕透露安葬地點，鼎爺與細孖李泳豪傷心欲絕，父子三人決裂。幸而鼎爺與李泳豪已走出陰霾，李泳豪常與台灣太太林妤謙（Agnes）周遊列國，近年更忽然身價急升，與Agnes拉頭馬！</p><figure><img alt=\"李家鼎透露有李泳豪夫婦及親弟妹的陪伴。（影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141581540719857664543027.jpeg/K7Bd1HXXiHnxrUbT1gJpTNMxvKL1RugHYJkJ2mCZCdo\"/><figcaption>李家鼎透露有李泳豪夫婦及親弟妹的陪伴。（影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪多次被李泳漢指逼鼎爺分身家，取走鼎爺340萬存款。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135915434009169920071259.jpeg/nZ07xTbDGodmdX4voP0xRQIqOLF3kF2soRE4gqEROII\"/><figcaption>李泳豪多次被李泳漢指逼鼎爺分身家，取走鼎爺340萬存款。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>李泳豪與太太拉頭馬</p><p>李泳豪今日（11月3日）在Instagram分享多張照片。照片中，李泳豪與太太身處馬場，穿上米色西裝，打扮得體大方。李泳豪與太太又手持獎盃，並到餐廳一邊睇馬一邊歎美酒佳餚，度過愉快一日。李泳豪又分享一張眾人拉頭馬的照片，不過相中則不見李泳豪和Agnes。李泳豪發文透露與好友慶祝拉頭馬：「與太太及好友們一齊拉頭馬 實在是非常珍貴的一刻」。</p><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪與媽媽施明。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260719/1155580384801460224810537.png/NlByHWouqDXqs2BCKlHBl-xFoLUQWazgMWZ-ZDFmfmQ\"/><figcaption>李泳豪與媽媽施明。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>李泳豪早前因家族風波成為全城焦點，隨後他食住人氣開設YouTube頻道「豪仔 ON AIR」，拉埋爸爸「鼎爺」李家鼎出鏡，訂閱數極速飆破10萬，獲平台頒發的10萬訂閱銀獎牌，早前他與太太「快閃」中山嘆美食，Agnes孭的是LV手袋，過得相當不錯！</p><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪與太太Agnes拉頭馬。（IG@drift_greg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339112153780224624730.png/qscdZiu77f89aX3fL7fSGgTYpRw24rtDXBfCxFwXwsQ\"/><figcaption>李泳豪與太太Agnes拉頭馬。（IG@drift_greg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪與太太身價暴增。（IG@drift_greg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339109750312960642357.png/y3FVN8OW3q5mUyDx5ysOFAoVGrny6pNqdqIJbnaiCW4\"/><figcaption>李泳豪與太太身價暴增。（IG@drift_greg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪與太太嘆美食。（IG@drift_greg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339107296514048572013.png/FitaaOMvz6K-Pc7K7twqSdocMa0-BytviKrSV4iq0lc\"/><figcaption>李泳豪與太太嘆美食。（IG@drift_greg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪拉頭馬。（IG@drift_greg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339104859492352235769.png/cN6e17_G9M9_qtL0_qywNYJg-W0nRD61-HfJlPh3yZQ\"/><figcaption>李泳豪拉頭馬。（IG@drift_greg）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李泳豪分享開心一刻。（IG@drift_greg）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194339102749626368346792.png/d7GoPb_MWS-AhrG-bnchbDgyfTyhSxVQzh6lSM4epUg\"/><figcaption>李泳豪分享開心一刻。（IG@drift_greg）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:14.777907+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":655,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:59:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:18:37.122341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:38.579381+00:00","content_hash":"4733474bf942bb0e80dc5f8507440ad8a3c07d0aa06dcb3db86346d3236a48a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}